window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I ran from one hot fae guy who wasn't interested in me, and ended up in the arms of another.<br> <br> We're just friends, me and Remmo.<br> <br> Just. Friends.<br> <br> Never mind the way he smells.<br> <br> Or the sparks that fly between us—literally.<br> <br> He's showing me around Vevol while I get over my heartbreak, and then we'll go back to our friends and break the temporary mate bond we've created.<br> <br> At least, that's my plan.<br> <br> But then we make it back to our friends, and everything changes....</p> <p>This is the fourth in a series of steamy connected standalones. Humor and happily ever after guaranteed.</p>"; 
